  {
    "id": 1571,
    "date": "2022-12-01T18:52:30+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "A short story of three lives.\n\nWhen Mary was 34, Paul was 32, and a son named William was born unto them.  When Paul was 44, and William was 12, Mary died at the age of 46.  Ten years later, when Paul was 56, his son William was lost at sea. His son was 24 years of age at the time he disappeared.\n\nPaul lived 16 more years to be 72, then he died.  Now all that is left of these three lives is this granite stone engraving in the corner of this tiny forgotten graveyard.  While still alive, they all lived in a very nice neighborhood in rural northern Virginia.\n\nhttps://goo.gl/maps/UQSQGTYUivsCgGeu6",
    "media": "1571.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 1572,
    "date": "2022-12-09T17:17:17+00:00",
