    "date": "2022-12-10T17:11:08+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "The purpose of this photo blog is for you to see the world through my eyes. \n\nWe will conduct this experiment through posting photos of the world as I see it. \n\nI cannot text often because its a distraction from my survival skills.\n\nIf you see a photo that brings up a question, direct reply to me.",
